# Local builds, tools and backups; source remains under Source/.
/Builds/
/Source/OSSYSCOPER/
**/.tools/
**/dist/
**/bin/
**/obj/
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# The native bridge is a required build input, not a generated managed output.
!Source/az-winui/native/bin/
!Source/az-winui/native/bin/AmdAdlxBridge.dll
# Obtain AMD's separately licensed SDK from its upstream repository.
Source/az-winui/native/adlx/*
